if {tried_talking_sharko} == false:
	[end_timeline]
[background arg="res://assets/misc/black.png" fade="0.0"]
join anemon leftmost
join whale center
anemon: We'd like to request your intervention Abigawhale. We've spoken with most of the residents but Sharko refuses to talk to us. While this is highly suspicious we want to give him a chance to give us his version of the facts. Could you make him talk to us ?
whale: I won't force him to to speak.
anemon: Then maybe you could convince him ?
[wait time="1.0"]
whale: I suppose you could give him with food...
join shrimp_can center [z_index="1"]
whale: Here take this, it's always been his favorite.
leave whale [animation="Fade Out" length="0.2"]
update anemon (Alone)
join joe right
joe: A can of shrimp ?
[signal arg="gain_can"]
set {NextDialogue.whale} = "whale_wailing"